<https://entur.org/ontology/shapes> a owl:Ontology ;
    dcterms:title "netex-entur.ttl: shapes generated from profile:cardinality" ;
    rdfs:comment "Generated by scripts/generate-shapes.py from the profile:cardinality, profile:allowedValues and profile:severity of the members in netex-entur.ttl, where the profile is stricter than the XSD (docs/adr/0002, docs/adr/0003). Do not hand-edit; change the membership and regenerate." ;
    prov:wasAttributedTo <https://github.com/entur/nordic-netex-ontology/blob/main/scripts/generate-shapes.py> .

